&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;NOTRE ENGAGEMENT EN FAVEUR DE L&#39;INCLUSION ET DE L&#39;ACCESSIBILITE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16&quot;&gt;Chez Decathlon, nous reconnaissons l&#39;immense valeur qu&#39;apporte la diversité à nos équipes et nous nous efforçons continuellement de favoriser et de cultiver un lieu de travail inclusif et équitable : c&#39;est pourquoi l&#39;Inclusion est l&#39;un de nos Fondamentaux Humains. Nous encourageons les personnes de tous horizons et de toutes capacités à postuler, car nous sommes convaincu·es que la diversité des pensées, des cultures, des identités et des expériences vécues nous rend plus fort·es. Decathlon s&#39;engage également à offrir un processus de sélection inclusif et accessible à tous les candidat·es. En cas de besoin d&#39;aménagement, tu peux en faire la demande via le formulaire de candidature, celle-ci sera confidentielle. Ces demandes n&#39;affectent pas le résultat du processus de recrutement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d&#39;offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C&#39;est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l&#39;environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Wheely&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wheely is redefining premium transportation across major cities in Europe, the US, and the Middle East. We blend cutting-edge technology with the craft of five-star chauffeuring to deliver an experience trusted by more than 100,000 active riders and 1,200 corporate accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a profitable, fast-growing scale-up with $43M raised and over $100M in annual revenue. Having recently launched in New York City, we’re expanding rapidly across the US and EMEA. If you take pride in your craft and want to help shape the next chapter of our growth, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a&lt;strong&gt; Senior Operations Manager in Paris&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll be a senior member of the France Operations team, reporting to the General Manager, France. You&#39;ll own the day-to-day health of the market — acquiring, retaining, and driving quality among our best-in-class chauffeurs — and help evolve the local operating model as we scale beyond Paris.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an entrepreneurial, high-ownership role in a fast-moving environment, not a caretaker seat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why This Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-growth business.&lt;/strong&gt; Paris is scaling and we&#39;re actively expanding into new markets — you&#39;ll help shape how we operate as we grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct impact.&lt;/strong&gt; Chauffeur acquisition, supply and retention — your calls move the metrics that define the market&#39;s health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real ownership.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll build and lead the local ops team, processes, and operating rhythms yourself, not inherit someone else&#39;s.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own day-to-day operational execution: chauffeur supply growth and retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve the local operating model, turning global strategy and standards into effective execution on the ground.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data to spot operational risks and opportunities, and design initiatives with clear, measurable impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and grow Wheely Paris&#39;s operations team, building a culture of high performance and engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product teams to shape feature development and improve operational tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support readiness as the market expands into new areas, launching business from scratch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior point of contact for chauffeurs and key external stakeholders, representing Wheely&#39;s standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with applicable French regulations and VTC licensing requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No single background defines success here — we want analytically strong, entrepreneurial operators motivated by ownership and comfortable being accountable for outcomes in open-ended environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-4+ years building, growing, or scaling something meaningful with limited structure, with the ability to move fast from analysis to execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relevant backgrounds include:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;scaling operations in a fast-paced tech environment (VC-backed business, scale-up, startup);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;top-tier management consulting, investment banking, or VC/PE; early or founding-team experience at a consumer or marketplace startup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;experience in a marketplace/platform business (on-demand, mobility, location-based);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;track record building teams or operating models from scratch or through rapid expansion;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MBA or advanced degree in business, operations, analytics, or strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent French and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in Paris, ability to work in the office 4 days a week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we Offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Office-based role in Paris (9th arrondissement)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee stock options plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life and critical illness cover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Best-in-class equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly credit towards Wheely journeys&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Daily Lunch Allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigo and Veligo travel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;All of your personal information will be collected stored and processed in accordance with&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://wheely.com/en/legal/uk/for-candidates/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Wheely’s Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;758&quot; data-local-id=&quot;349f5d1d97ae&quot;&gt;We are seeking a Staff Applied AI Researcher to join a fast-growing team building an agent-native search platform - the web access layer for AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;912&quot; data-local-id=&quot;52da8de25c65&quot;&gt;You can think of this as Google search, but for AI agents: a system designed for machines, not humans. We are building agentic search, where AI systems actively plan, retrieve, evaluate, and refine information rather than simply returning results. As AI becomes the primary interface to the web, this layer will replace the role of traditional search engines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1273&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8ba2f733eb98&quot;&gt;We are designing these systems to search and reason over web data in real time, under strict latency and reliability constraints. This means solving retrieval, ranking and passage extraction under entirely new access patterns and at significant scale, with systems operating over constantly changing, unstructured data and serving tens of thousands of production workloads 24/7.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1653&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dc8aefa0b2c5&quot;&gt;This role comes with ownership over key parts of our applied AI research direction and system design, with a strong expectation of defining new approaches and shipping measurable impact in production. In the first year, you will own a specific part of the search stack, e.g. ranking or iterative retrieval.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1961&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3a68defafc73&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll work on:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b2d49ed7-2072-4623-afb5-0f3e46fb9eff&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1985&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dbde4a36f318&quot;&gt;Designing an agent-native search system that handles everything from low-latency single-hop search to complex deep search tasks requiring iterative planning, querying, refinement and reasoning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2182&quot; data-local-id=&quot;330562c2b43d&quot;&gt;Training ranking and retrieval models optimized for agent-driven workflows under real world constraints&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2289&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a80b20c7f5e2&quot;&gt;Bringing the latest advances from the research community to our search stack and ship it to production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2396&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c5f3d6d01f8e&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ca556365-56d6-4b18-a6ab-e96d32aada2a&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2422&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ba12fa15e8c5&quot;&gt;Drive applied research and technical direction across retrieval and ranking systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2509&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0ac01c95d3f6&quot;&gt;Design and evolve multi-stage retrieval architectures (query understanding, rewriting, retrieval, reranking and iterative retrieval)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2645&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bdd93b58a974&quot;&gt;Lead experimentation on modern retrieval approaches (embedding research, sparse and hybrid retrieval, reranking, context compression) and bring them into production&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2813&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5d99bb2639e8&quot;&gt;Develop methods for grounding LLMs in real-time web data at scale, using trust, quality and freshness signals to surface reliable sources&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2954&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5b539cf905a3&quot;&gt;Partner with the evaluation team to define new metrics for agentic systems, where correctness is not reducible to clicks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3078&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7f6ed1a6999b&quot;&gt;Analyze trade-offs across relevance, latency, and cost, and work closely with engineering to deploy systems that operate at web scale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3215&quot; data-local-id=&quot;98cbe59fe7ce&quot;&gt;Mentor researchers and engineers and help raise the technical bar of the team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3296&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4e7298218846&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Must haves:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;288927ca-3161-4538-89a9-be6a7978542a&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3311&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3c107fbda2c8&quot;&gt;8+ years of experience in applied AI, ML, or software engineering&lt;/p&gt;
